{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-11-09T19:21:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119873003878236359"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Muse Ember is our smallest and most efficient model, designed for complex reasoning execution and the work agents repeat all day.","display_url":"research.meta.ai/blog/muse-ember","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://research.meta.ai/blog/muse-ember","images":[{"height":2160,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122585730996457472/1Ssii0-S?format=jpg&name=orig","width":3840},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122585730996457472/1Ssii0-S?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":0,"status":200,"title":"Introducing Our Smallest, Most Efficient Model: Muse Ember","unwound_url":"https://research.meta.ai/blog/muse-ember","url":"https://t.co/ZbdM0D1iVN"}]},"id":"2119873003878236359","lang":"zxx","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1861,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119873002338947109","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"https://t.co/ZbdM0D1iVN"},{"created_at":"2026-11-09T19:21:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119873002338947109"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":23,"id":"1034844617261248512","start":14,"username":"AIatMeta"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/jeWy0hvV9l","end":180,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cline/status/2119873002338947109/photo/1","media_key":"3_2119872883849826304","start":157,"url":"https://t.co/jeWy0hvV9l"}]},"id":"2119873002338947109","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":7739,"like_count":135,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":5},"text":"Muse Ember by @AIatMeta is now in Cline! \n\nA lightweight model that’s fast, low-cost, and purpose-built for subagent work like coding and document analysis. https://t.co/jeWy0hvV9l"},{"created_at":"2026-10-29T19:13:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115884856064479702"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"NVIDIA released Nemotron 3.5 Super VL on October 15, and we reached 11,840 aggregate output tokens/sec on one GB300 with 256 concurrent requests. This blog post is a walkthrough of all the tricks we used to get there. For context, this model is specifically designed to be a really fast, locally hosted model that can perform reasonably well across domains like document intelligence, coding, financial accounting, etc. For the cluster of models in the same category, it turns out to be much","display_url":"cline.bot/blog/11-840-tp…","end":121,"expanded_url":"https://cline.bot/blog/11-840-tps-on-a-single-gpu","images":[{"height":941,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115884863232569344/_gF0UIky?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1672},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115884863232569344/_gF0UIky?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":98,"status":200,"title":"11,840 TPS on a single GPU","unwound_url":"https://cline.bot/blog/11-840-tps-on-a-single-gpu","url":"https://t.co/USdn4s08G4"}]},"id":"2115884856064479702","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2430,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115884854139380134","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"We wrote more about the tricks we used and the future of local models and agentic inference here:\nhttps://t.co/USdn4s08G4"},{"created_at":"2026-10-29T19:13:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115884854139380134"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/WfKaT62r8f","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cline/status/2115884854139380134/photo/1","media_key":"3_2115883534070296576","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/WfKaT62r8f"}]},"id":"2115884854139380134","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":8248,"like_count":103,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":7},"text":"We nearly doubled throughput for Nemotron 3.5 Super VL on a single GB300 GPU, from 6,058 → 11,840 tok/s, with five configuration changes in vLLM.\n\nThese let the model draft tokens ahead, keep the GPU from ever sitting idle, and store the model’s memory at half precision. https://t.co/WfKaT62r8f"},{"created_at":"2026-10-28T17:50:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115501578916601925"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/O1uTjzdMFJ","end":204,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/cline/status/2115501578916601925/photo/1","media_key":"3_2115501510461476864","start":181,"url":"https://t.co/O1uTjzdMFJ"}]},"id":"2115501578916601925","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":108,"impression_count":44265,"like_count":1458,"quote_count":16,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":78},"text":"Gemini 4 Carbon is the first model to surpass Claude and GPT, and beats Opus 5.5 on nearly every benchmark at half the cost.\n\nThat’s an 18% improvement in only 2 weeks since Argon. https://t.co/O1uTjzdMFJ"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115181476685983953"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Open-source AI coding agent with Plan/Act modes, MCP integration, and terminal-first workflows. Trusted by 11M+ developers worldwide.","display_url":"cline.bot","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://cline.bot/","images":[{"height":630,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122672889493143553/_rpfhWZA?format=png&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2122672889493143553/_rpfhWZA?format=png&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":0,"status":200,"title":"Cline - AI Coding, Open Source and Open Choice","unwound_url":"https://cline.bot/","url":"https://t.co/5IvtXLhtIH"}]},"id":"2115181476685983953","lang":"zxx","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1146,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115181475012497776","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"https://t.co/5IvtXLhtIH"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115171243028828428"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":27,"id":"171001197